  return <><PageHeading eyebrow="MONDAY, OCTOBER 5, 2026" title={`Good morning, ${displayName.split(' ')[0]}.`} subtitle="A little progress each day adds up. Here’s your learning pulse." action={<button className="date-select"><CalendarDays size={15}/> Fall semester <ChevronDown size={14}/></button>}/><div className="welcome-banner"><div className="welcome-copy"><div className="banner-kicker"><span/> YOUR WEEKLY CHECK-IN</div><h2>You’re finding your rhythm.</h2><p>You’ve shown up, put in the work, and made this week yours. Keep going, one small step at a time.</p><div className="banner-stats"><div><b>8.7</b><span>Study score</span></div><i/><div><b>12 days</b><span>Learning streak</span></div><i/><div><b>+6%</b><span>Since last month</span></div></div></div><div className="banner-art"><div className="art-sun"/><div className="art-book"><BookOpen size={35}/></div><div className="art-star star-one">✳</div><div className="art-star star-two">✦</div><div className="art-dot dot-a"/><div className="art-dot dot-b"/></div></div><div className="metrics-grid student-metrics"><Metric icon={CalendarCheck} label="ATTENDANCE" value="82%" detail={<><span className="positive">↑ 4%</span> compared to last month</>} tone="blue"/><Metric icon={ClipboardCheck} label="TO DO" value="03" detail="One assignment due tomorrow" tone="violet"/><Metric icon={BookMarked} label="COURSE PROGRESS" value="68%" detail="Across your 3 classes" tone="mint"/></div><div className="dashboard-columns student-columns"><section className="panel learning-panel"><PanelHeader title="Pick up where you left off" subtitle="Small steps count. Keep the momentum." action="My curriculum" onAction={()=>setView('My classes')}/>{[['Data Structures','Unit 4 · Graph algorithms',72,'blue'],['Machine Learning','Unit 3 · Regression models',54,'violet'],['Operating Systems','Unit 5 · Memory management',84,'mint']].map(([name,unit,pct,tone])=><div className="course-progress" key={name}><div className={`course-mark mark-${tone}`}><BookOpen size={18}/></div><div className="course-copy"><div><b>{name}</b><span>{unit}</span></div><small>{pct}%</small><Progress value={pct} tone={tone}/></div><button className="course-check" title="Mark one study step complete" onClick={e=>{e.currentTarget.classList.toggle('checked');e.currentTarget.innerHTML=e.currentTarget.classList.contains('checked')?'✓':'+'}}><Plus size={15}/></button></div>)}</section><section className="panel focus-panel"><div className="focus-top"><div><span className="eyebrow">YOUR NEXT BEST STEP</span><h2>A short study sprint?</h2></div><div className="focus-spark"><Sparkles size={19}/></div></div><p>Your ML quiz is coming up. Review a few regression examples today, and you’ll feel much more ready.</p><div className="focus-meta"><span><Clock3 size={14}/> 25 minutes</span><span><BookOpen size={14}/> Machine Learning</span></div><button className="btn btn-primary btn-wide" onClick={()=>setView('Assignments')}>Start a study session <ArrowRight size={15}/></button><div className="focus-divider"/><div className="quiz-invite"><div className="quiz-icon"><Sparkles size={16}/></div><div><b>Ready to check what you know?</b><span>Build a quick quiz from your course material.</span></div><button onClick={()=>setQuizOpen(true)} aria-label="Generate a quiz"><ArrowRight size={17}/></button></div></section></div></>;
